WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.368
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:03.903
This is "Late Night."
How's everybody doing tonight?

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:06.239
[ Cheers and applause ]
Good to hear.

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:08.140
In that case,
let's get to the news.

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:11.144
House Republican leader
Kevin McCarthy failed to secure

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:13.646
enough votes to ascend
to the Speakership today

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:15.148
after a fifth ballot.

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:17.316
Incidentally, a fifth is also

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:19.152
what he drank during the vote.

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:20.152
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.152 --> 00:00:21.821
"Son of a gun."

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:23.155
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.155 --> 00:00:24.524
20 House Republicans voted

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:26.493
against GOP leader
Kevin McCarthy

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:28.161
during today's fifth
Speaker ballot.

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:29.996
God, you guys can't even have

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:32.499
a red wave amongst yourselves.

00:00:32.499 --> 00:00:34.000
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.168
The White House said yesterday
that President Biden has

00:00:36.168 --> 00:00:39.138
no plans to intervene
in the House Speaker election

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:41.641
after Republican Kevin McCarthy
failed to secure enough votes

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:44.477
during the second ballot
to ascend to the Speakership,

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:47.480
at least not until it stops
being hilarious.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.482
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:51.151
During his inaugural address
yesterday,

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:53.986
Florida governor Ron DeSantis
criticized Democrats' agenda

00:00:53.986 --> 00:00:57.490
and said, quote, "Florida
is where woke goes to die."

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:58.958
In fact,

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:01.293
it's where
everything goes to die.

00:01:01.293 --> 00:01:03.128
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:03.128 --> 00:01:04.797
So, to be fair.

00:01:04.797 --> 00:01:07.533
According to newly released
Congressional testimony,

00:01:07.533 --> 00:01:09.935
ex-White House adviser
Kellyanne Conway said

00:01:09.935 --> 00:01:12.271
that former President Trump
is afraid

00:01:12.271 --> 00:01:14.273
of former First Lady
Melania Trump.

00:01:14.273 --> 00:01:16.543
Well, she IS an immigrant.

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:17.544
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:19.212
Disgraced...

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.183
Disgraced cryptocurrency
exchange founder

00:01:23.183 --> 00:01:25.951
Sam Bankman-Fried pleaded
not guilty yesterday

00:01:25.951 --> 00:01:28.421
in federal court
on a series of charges

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:29.756
including money laundering,

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:31.424
which from the looks of him

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:34.093
may be the only thing
he's ever laundered.

00:01:34.093 --> 00:01:35.795
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:37.797
The Southwest Airlines
pilot union

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:39.298
published a letter yesterday

00:01:39.298 --> 00:01:41.634
denouncing the carrier's
leadership and said

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:43.970
the company was turning
into a cult.

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.672
Even worse, they only give you

00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:47.507
half a Kool-Aid.

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:49.509
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:58.384
Anytime you can make a joke
both about how small

00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:00.720
the beverage servings are
on airlines

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.722
and Jonestown...

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:06.025
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:08.694
...comedy gold.

00:02:08.694 --> 00:02:10.196
A woman in West Virginia

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:12.198
recently had her wallet
returned to her

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:16.869
nearly 55 years after she
lost it at a high school dance.

00:02:16.869 --> 00:02:18.371
"That's not all she lost,"

00:02:18.371 --> 00:02:20.707
said her 54-year-old daughter.

00:02:20.707 --> 00:02:22.775
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:31.217
You guys did the math
very quickly.

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:32.551
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.551 --> 00:02:35.221
The makers of International
Delight coffee creamer

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:37.223
have announced they will release
a new flavor

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:40.225
inspired by the Central Perk
coffee shop on "Friends."

00:02:40.225 --> 00:02:43.563
Although, I don't know
if you can call vanilla "new."

00:02:43.563 --> 00:02:45.565
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.733 --> 00:02:49.735
Two people in Florida
were arrested recently

00:02:49.735 --> 00:02:52.238
after one of them allegedly
called 911

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:53.740
to get help moving items

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:56.209
from a home
they were burglarizing.

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:58.544
But to be fair,
the police did help.

00:02:58.544 --> 00:03:00.880
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:04.216
It's a jail cell.

00:03:04.216 --> 00:03:07.219
When you put too much
nice furniture in a jail cell,

00:03:07.219 --> 00:03:10.556
it just looks like a studio
apartment in New York City.

00:03:10.556 --> 00:03:12.225
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.225 --> 00:03:14.560
Like, everybody saw that,
they were like, "Well, ehhh..."

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:15.961
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.961 --> 00:03:17.964
"You say I get
three meals a day?"

00:03:17.964 --> 00:03:19.132
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.132 --> 00:03:20.500
And finally, a man in Idaho

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.168
recently set
a Guinness World Record

00:03:22.168 --> 00:03:26.839
after stomping 100 balloons
in 22.38 seconds.

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:29.842
It was for Most Ruined
Birthday Party.

00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:31.511
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.511 --> 00:03:34.080
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

